# 29-remove-chaintx-limit.patch
#   Remove / raise MEMPOOL_ANCESTOR_LIMIT + MEMPOOL_DESCENDANT_LIMIT policy caps.
#   Both eCash and BCH have done this. Straightforward policy change.
#   Open questions before writing:
#     - Mempool eviction strategy when chains grow large (currently evicts by
#       descendant fee; removing the cap means eviction pressure can be much
#       deeper — need to bound worst-case eviction walk).
#     - May want a softer raise (e.g. 1000) rather than unlimited, at least
#       until the O(n²) mining construction is fixed.
#
# 30-nlogn-block-construction.patch
#   Fix O(n²) CreateNewBlock: ancestor/descendant score walks are repeated per
#   candidate tx. Replace with a pre-sorted heap keyed by ancestor fee rate so
#   each tx is considered O(log n) times.
#   NOTE: Shammah has a prior patch for this — locate and port before writing.
#   eCash and BCH removed the chain limit but did NOT fix this; upstreaming
#   would be a genuine improvement for both chains.
